sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + gateway-root-of-trust-keys (Gateway signs) + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS 2 (DNS held, same-Node work).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Route Node<br/>Caddy over ssh
  CLI->>GW: route:create<br/>{domain: shop.test, instance: 42}
  Note over GW: Validate, reserve domain<br/>Route pending · task route.create
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-route-create
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5120
  SW->>N: Request a CSR<br/>@swamp/ssh · node_batch.py
  N-->>SW: CSR, key stays on Node
  SW->>GW: Ask to sign the CSR<br/>certificate-sign primitive
  GW-->>SW: Signed leaf<br/>Orbit CA stays in Gateway
  SW->>N: Install cert, Caddyfile<br/>caddy validate, then reload
  Note over SW: DNS publication held<br/>native-dns-takeover-held
  alt all steps succeed
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Project result<br/>Route active · task succeeded
  else a step fails
    Note over SW: Restore prior state<br/>route-mutation-restore
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
    Note over GW: Route failed<br/>task failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5120
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
